{"generated": "2026-07-29 14:45", "curation": {"market": "개인 투자자 여러분, 안녕하십니까. 지난 24시간 동안 시장은 국내외적으로 매우 불안정한 모습을 보였습니다. 핵심 테마를 중심으로 현재 시장 상황을 브리핑해 드립니다.\n\n<b>국내 증시의 전례 없는 패닉 장세</b>\n코스피와 코스닥 시장은 이틀 연속 동반 서킷브레이커가 발동되는 등 전례 없는 급락세를 보였습니다. 코스피는 장중 5300선, 5700선, 심지어 6000선까지 붕괴되었고, 코스닥도 700선이 무너지며 투자자들의 패닉 셀링이 이어졌습니다. 이는 역대급 증시 패닉으로 평가되며, 국내 증시의 불안정성이 극대화된 상황입니다. [<a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#2</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#5</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#6</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE1DMEg3Z0RXNmNsTDVsS2dRbFYtdWxsOE13bFo0OU5iS2ppV3FLbTJvWXJmUFptbDNTZjJNSzhyV0ZlWF9TOFRhNmVNTDZnVHpIZXdJRXBabU1sUQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#8</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE16Ui1wWnptbGtIbURqbzNMajlpRUJzalV4aC1FYmJiNUQwQjBzWnFOX0x5VUJ6NWVraVk5QUZNTHAtRkpsekVQTEMxOW1SMDJWekd0NDRNM3NlS0HSAWBBVV95cUxQNjJHODFscllNbDVBb0J5cktvSmdFcW1LTGVSQURpRnFOSXplYkVnNmZPWmFSM3FnMmUyRkE4Z1dtalRXQlhmLW1xbDlXUDQ2Zkxza0RRYlpyMVVRNHp0WU0?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#12</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTE9pNEVwb1dyMHhBeXpxQ1JwSTNzYWRQLTFxZmx6Rks2X0JQRTJFTkdxd2FpVmZ0ZlhnaFVELWRLYTZuOU9Ld1pRdm02WHFhbHk1MDVQQWZyYzhpcU5ndWpRaHF4S2czdVlpcDdNald3?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#16</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE1oQVNzRU03YzZDRERGdjVJTFRnVjhSMGNELS0ycHRWdkI4YVVSQ053N3loLXVNVkFpZTBJQjkweGc1ZElKLTlpbzVySnByM1k2anpoVmhGOGZyeEZnbVRVWXdHd1NfUHhLdXc?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#17</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9qempwcjNjT1ctS0pZMDBMOXhLOUVzN0ZQWk5EQVlpcnZPMENFSnVmSlpPWWhrTUF0bWZ0SVZDZHBCM1ZFd0UzWFRhSXhBR0FfSFI3NFlLUkFfQVMwX1E?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#19</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTE9zZEpTaHozTGhzUDdlTV85WlJOUWxYb3R